              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KZJNK"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this recipe was quite good but there are a few things I will make special note to you of. I put the cloves in the apple slices as suggested, but I think I put far to many. Next time I would just use a few. Also I thought it tasted better to fill the glass about 1/3 full of wine mixture and 2/3 with soda. This is a very light and refreshing drink. Very pretty in a glass pitcher w/the fruit pieces."
