              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "East TN Gigi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow! This turned out great! Love being able to have restaurant-quality sangria at home! I left out the cloves and adjusted the fruit to what I had on hand, and it still turned out wonderful. I tried to use this same recipe for white wine, and it was a flop. I will stick to red on this one :)",
